  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "Kara坐在客厅的白色沙发上，客厅里有着高高的天花板、大大的窗户和木地板。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "70390369",
    "20328233",
    "80347846"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/fe/dc/fedc23177ab0d74137a7912e78fec15d.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
